==German==

===Etymology===
Via {{etyl|nds-de|de}} from {{etyl|gml|de}} {{m|gml|küken}}. Cognate to Dutch {{m|nl|kuiken}}, English {{m|en|chicken}}. A related form is {{cog|gmh|kuchil}}, whence now obsolete {{m|de|Küchlein}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈkyːkən/|[ˈkyːkən]|[ˈkyːkŋ̩]|lang=de}}
